{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/Humble_Bee_Cover_v9_steam_about_game.png?t=1732204839\" /><br><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</u></strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/2023-05-20_Steam_Long_Description_gif.gif?t=1732204839\" /><br>Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</u></strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/2023-05-20_Steam_Long_Description_Deckbuilding3.gif?t=1732204839\" /><br>A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Lose yourself in huge maps, and get the zoomies:</u></strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/2023-05-20_Steam_Long_Description_Explore.gif?t=1732204839\" /><br>Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit<br></li><li>Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!<br></li><li>A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart<br></li><li>De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines<br></li><li>Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering </li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're not my Boss","path":"http